:INFO
Art. 7 Implementation and further development of the CRS MCAA
1 The rights and obligations of Reporting Swiss Financial Institutions in the context of the implementation of the CRS MCAA are governed by the Annex to the CRS MCAA and by this Act.
2 The Federal Council may incorporate amendments to the CRS into the Annex to the CRS MCAA, provided that these amendments are of limited scope.
3 The following in particular are deemed to be amendments of limited scope:
a. those which do not create new obligations or remove existing rights for reportable persons or reporting Swiss financial institutions;
b. those which concern the authorities and govern administrative-technical issues.
|

